    description: "Create a row-level validation rule in iceDQ. Each check evaluates conditions on individual rows. Supported checks: NotNull, ValidValues, Format (Email/Phone/SSN/ZipCode/URL/IP), Length, Date, Custom (Groovy). CRITICAL: Combine ALL checks for the same table into ONE rule \u2014 do not create separate rules per check type. Custom checks use VALIDATION PATTERN: TRUE = row passes, FALSE = row fails. Rule is Published immediately. NOT SUPPORTED in validation rules (use dedicated tools): Uniqueness \u2192 create_duplicate_rule. Cross-table/Referential integrity \u2192 create_pushdown_rule. Count comparison \u2192 create_checksum_rule. Row-by-row recon \u2192 create_recon_rule.",
