    description: `List all user-defined custom functions (UDFs) in a workspace. Returns custom function metadata including id, className, language (Java/Groovy), type, description, status, createdBy, createdAt, updatedTimestamp. Use this to see available functions before using them in validation rules. **PAGINATION BEHAVIOR**: Always default to pageNo=1 and pageSize=${DEFAULT_PAGE_SIZE_20} when not specified. After returning results, always ask the user: 'Would you like me to fetch the next page?'`,
